BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:187311ca7a24a52e0cb5@eu-esg-tracker
DTSTAMP:20261003T024915Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280727
SUMMARY:LkSG must be replaced by the law transposing the CSDDD
DESCRIPTION:German Supply Chain Due Diligence Act (Lieferkettensorgfaltsp
 flichtengesetz). Applies. The annual report is no longer checked in prac
 tice\, and an amendment bill deleting the reporting duty has been in the
  Bundestag since January 2026 without a final vote. On 2 July 2026 the c
 oalition announced a one-to-one transposition of the CSDDD and a narrowe
 r scope of the LkSG\; no draft for that had been published when this ent
 ry was last checked.
URL:https://yanfuh321-dot.github.io/eu-esg-tracker/#/regulation/de-lksg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eebffe6e3e83fff13ee5@eu-esg-tracker
DTSTAMP:20261003T024915Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270319
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270320
SUMMARY:CSRD in Germany deadline for transposing the Omnibus I changes
DESCRIPTION:German act transposing the CSRD (CSRD-Umsetzungsgesetz). In t
 he Bundestag. The coalition tabled amendments in March 2026 to build in 
 Omnibus I\, and the legal affairs committee held a hearing on 13 April 2
 026. Whether the final vote and publication in the Federal Law Gazette h
 ave taken place could not be confirmed when this entry was last checked\
 ; until the act is in force\, the 2017 rules on the non-financial statem
 ent (sections 289b and following of the Commercial Code) continue to app
 ly.
URL:https://yanfuh321-dot.github.io/eu-esg-tracker/#/regulation/de-csrd
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
